      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778279476237,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Single Value, monotonically increasing counter\n- Resets to a value(zero) or only increase does not decrease.\n- Rate() function:\n    takes history of metrics over a time frame & calculates\n    how fast the value is increaseing per second.\n - Rate applicable only for counter values only\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Single Value, monotonically increasing counter\n- Resets to a value(zero) or only increase does not decrease.\n- Rate() function:\n    takes history of metrics over a time frame & calculates\n    how fast the value is increaseing per second.\n - Rate applicable only for counter values only\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
