      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Gauge is a single numerical value (number), it either goes up \n    or down. ( ex no of pods no of events)\n- promQL : max_over_time, min_over_time, avg_over_time \n   can be used on gauge metrics \n- temperature, current memory usage",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Gauge is a single numerical value (number), it either goes up \n    or down. ( ex no of pods no of events)\n- promQL : max_over_time, min_over_time, avg_over_time \n   can be used on gauge metrics \n- temperature, current memory usage",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
