      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "JMX MBEAN.\n- JVM BAsed.\n- JMX objects have different datatypes\n- Requires JMX aware tool , JConsole, VisualVm\n- CUstom attributes(String, boolean)\n- JMX relies on RMI Protocol",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "YDOa1a9p-saPGKBPzqfNP",
      "originalText": "JMX MBEAN.\n- JVM BAsed.\n- JMX objects have different datatypes\n- Requires JMX aware tool , JConsole, VisualVm\n- CUstom attributes(String, boolean)\n- JMX relies on RMI Protocol",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
