      "updated": 1778281544828,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Prometheus - OPen metrics\n- Developed by Sound Cloud, Designed for cloud.\n- Line Based text ( open Metrics spec format)\n- Scrapped via standard HTTP endpoints\n- Numeric Time sereis( counter, gauges, histogram)\n- Pull based HTTP model",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "yRxmGUZYMdXSrRnZOFu9d",
      "originalText": "Prometheus - OPen metrics\n- Developed by Sound Cloud, Designed for cloud.\n- Line Based text ( open Metrics spec format)\n- Scrapped via standard HTTP endpoints\n- Numeric Time sereis( counter, gauges, histogram)\n- Pull based HTTP model",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
