      "updated": 1778281505502,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- OTel Collector,\n- Traces\n- instrument producer/consumer app, Use OpenTelemetry Agent on the client app.\n- good support for vaniall producer/consumer.  Industry issue with kafka streams,\nconnect.\n- Jaegar, ElasticSearch/kibana, splunk, Datadog, NewRelic support",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "UB5ZMO7XLXnwd14GD0y6y",
      "originalText": "- OTel Collector,\n- Traces\n- instrument producer/consumer app, Use OpenTelemetry Agent on the client app.\n- good support for vaniall producer/consumer.  Industry issue with kafka streams, connect.\n- Jaegar, ElasticSearch/kibana, splunk, Datadog, NewRelic support",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
