      "originalText": " // 2. Create the MBean instance\n        Counter counter = new Counter();\n\n        // 3. Create a unique ObjectName\n        ObjectName name = new ObjectName(\"com.example:type=Counter\");\n\n        // 4. Register the MBean\n        mbs.registerMBean(counter, name);\n\n        // Simulate application work\n        System.out.println(\"Application running. Press Enter to exit.\");\n        while (true) {\n            counter.increment();\n            Thread.sleep(2000);\n        }",
